@defopt pimacs-header-line-format @code{'(:context_usage " (" :compaction_mode ")" :spacer "(" :provider ") " :model " • " :thinking_level)}

Format of the Pimacs chat header line.

Strings are displayed literally.  Functions are called with the state
plist and their returned values are displayed.  A keyword component can
include text properties using @code{propertize} syntax.  For example:
"@code{(:model face font-lock-function-name-face)}".  A status component has
form @code{(:status STATUS-KEY PROPERTY VALUE...)}; it displays the text set
by an extension with STATUS-KEY and accepts optional text properties.
For example: @code{(:status "xyz-status" face font-lock-warning-face)}.

The following keywords are replaced with state information.

Session state keywords:
@table @code
@item :model
Model identifier.
@item :provider
Model provider.
@item :thinking_level
Thinking level.
@item :session_name
Session name.
@item :project_root
Project root directory.
@item :compaction_mode
@code{auto} or @code{manual}.
@item :message_count
Message count.
@item :pending_message_count
Pending message count.
@end table

Session statistics keywords:
@table @code
@item :user_messages
User message count.
@item :assistant_messages
Assistant message count.
@item :tool_calls
Tool call count.
@item :tool_results
Tool result count.
@item :total_messages
Total message count.
@item :input_tokens
Input token count.
@item :output_tokens
Output token count.
@item :cache_read_tokens
Cache-read token count.
@item :cache_write_tokens
Cache-write token count.
@item :cache_hit_percent
Total cache hit percentage.
@item :total_tokens
Total token count.
@item :cost
Session cost.
@item :context_usage
Context tokens and context window.
@item :context_tokens
Context token count.
@item :context_window
Context window size.
@end table

UI keywords:
@table @code
@item :agent_state
Current agent state.
@item :spinner
Active agent spinner.
@item :spacer
Space that right-aligns all following entries.
@end table

Status components:
@code{(:status STATUS-KEY ...)}  Extension status text for STATUS-KEY.

Use at most one @code{:spacer}.
@end defopt

@defopt pimacs-mode-line-format @code{'(" Pimacs " :agent_state :spinner)}

